sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant P as SentriFlowAddon
  participant R as Runtime
  participant U as Dashboard
  participant O as Origin
  C->>P: Buffered request
  P->>R: Redacted Flow and findings
  R-->>U: halt.requested with deadline
  Note over P,R: Await decision before HTTP forwarding
  alt User answers
    U->>R: action and scope
  else Timeout or shutdown
    R->>R: Default Block
  end
  R-->>U: halt.resolved
  R-->>P: Verdict
  alt Allow
    P->>O: Forward request
    O-->>P: Response chunks
    P-->>U: Byte counters through speed.tick
  else Block
    P-->>C: Local 403
  end
